<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak March PPI down 0.6 pct mo/mo, +4.2pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak March PPI down 0.6 pct mo/mo, +4.2pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak producer prices decreased 0.6 percent month-on-month in March 1997, taking the year-on-year increase to 4.2 percent, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SUSR did not provide comparative figures for March 1996, saying it had begun calculating PPI according to European Union standards from the beginning of this year.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
